    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑνοποι-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>combining in one, uniting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1045b17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Intr.</u>
				6.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>creating unity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				298
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>in Metaph.</u>
					439.25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
